rld fit inside it.\n\nMETA BOY brings that feeling back and puts it where it always belonged: floating right in front of you, razor sharp, enormous, impossible to look away from. A screen suspended in the dark, scanlines and four shades of scarlet, waiting for you to jump again.\n\n\nRun the Carrot Meadows, drop into the Red Caverns, then cross the Glass Sky \u2014 an archipelago of floating platforms where solid ground is a luxury. Every world hides high routes for the curious and the five letters only real explorers ever find.\n\nWHO THIS IS FOR\n\nFor anyone who remembers kneeling in front of a red screen until their neck hurt. And for anyone who never got the chance, and always wondered what it would have been like.\n\nYou do not have to wonder any more.\n", "short_description": "A whole world drawn in red. Exactly how you dreamed it as a kid.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/b213767d-aa74-4fc6-ac54-cefb1528b4fd", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Francisco Manuel Mier y Ter\u00e1n Almaz\u00e1n", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/b213767d-aa74-4fc6-ac54-cefb1528b4fd", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "TRACKED_KEYBOARD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1105823341883768"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUB